<h3>Landing time, not scheduled time</h3>
<p>Your pickup is set by when the aircraft actually touches down — we track the flight and adjust if it's early, late, or diverted.</p>
</div>
<div class="trust-item">
<div class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg></div>
<h3>Fare in writing, before dispatch</h3>
<p>You see the number and agree to it before a vehicle is assigned — not after the ride starts.</p>
</div>
<div class="trust-item">
<div class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-6"/></svg></div>
<h3>One founder, accountable</h3>
<p>If something goes wrong, you're calling the person who owns the outcome — not a regional support line.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section-soft">
